	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t07_hakase2_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チェレンから　ききました▼
プラズマだんと　なのる　れんちゅうが
いまいちど　でんせつの　ポケモンで▽
イッシュ　しはいを　もくろんでいると▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:16:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:16:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>チェレンから　ききました▼
プラズマ団と　名乗る　連中が
今一度　伝説の　ポケモンで▽
イッシュ支配を　目論んでいると▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:41:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:40:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・アララギ、主人公と向き合ってメッセージ表示
・続けて
　Black2→hakase2_03b
　White2→hakase2_03w</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-28T08:03:57" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>HAKASE2
アララギ博士娘</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T06:14:14" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>A</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T08:12:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
